    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "My name is Evelyn Jiang. I was born and raised in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Indonesia",
            "zh": "印度尼西亚"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", but my family came from China. My great-grandparents moved to Indonesia many years ago. From the time I was a little girl, I had the idea to go to university in China."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Ten years ago, I applied to study at Tongji University. I wanted to study in the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "College of Architecture and Urban Planning",
            "zh": "建筑与城市规划学院"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". However, I was "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "turned down",
            "ref": "v-turn-down"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". So I decided to study Chinese at Tongji for a year. This would help me to prepare for my application next year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "During that time, I joined a guitar club at Tongji by accident. At our first "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "rehearsal",
            "ref": "v-rehearsal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", a student played the guitar and sang a song he had written. The song had very beautiful "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "lyrics",
            "zh": "歌词"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ignited",
            "ref": "v-ignite"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " my "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "passion",
            "ref": "v-passion"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for music."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Later, I joined a band called Nevers. I spent three years studying and performing with the band members. After they graduated, I joined another band called ET. We took part in many different activities and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "competitions",
            "ref": "v-competition"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". We studied during the day and rehearsed in the evening."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "However, my fellow band members became busier and busier. We had less and less time to practice together. I began to enter competitions on my own. I also started writing my own songs. So far, I have published more than ten songs of my own. One of them is called "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Warmest Companion"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I wrote it for my friends, classmates and teachers in Shanghai."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I am now "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pursuing",
            "ref": "v-pursue"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " my graduate studies at Tongji University. I’m ready to continue my story and my dream of pursuing music here!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
